     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1046673">EVEX.128.66.0F38.W0 2C /r </para>
      <para unique="1046674">VSCALEFPS xmm1 {k1}{z}, xmm2, xmm3/m128/m32bcst</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046678">A</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046680">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046682">(AVX512VL AND AVX512F) OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+941941"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046690">Scale the packed single-precision floating-point values in xmm2 using values from xmm3/m128/m32bcst. Under writemask k1.</para>
